
USAGE
        HNodes
        HNodes <callsign>          (sysop)
        HNodes -X <callsign>       (sysop)

DESCRIPTION
        Shows the FPAC nodes heard by fpacrtd (discovery of new nodes):
	    provisional           = accepted provisionally, called as a neighbour
	    waiting for the sysop = heard, not accepted (FpacDiscover = ask)
	    invalidated           = refused by the sysop
	"linked" or "not linked" gives the state of the ROSE link.
	After the SYSop command, "HNodes <callsign>" accepts a node
	(fpacrtd -a) and "HNodes -X <callsign>" invalidates it (fpacrtd -x).
